            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "To obtain dataset in WRDS Compustat Global Annual Fundamentals:\n\nvar\t:\tOANCF,OIADP,OIBDP,OPPRFT,PI,PPEGT,PPENT,RE,RECT,REVT,STKCH,TXP,ACT,AO,AP,APCH,APO,ARTFS,AT,AU,AUOP,CH,CHE,DP,EBIT,IB,IBC,INVT,LCT,LT,CURCD,FYEAR,CONM,ISIN,SEDOL,EXCHG,FYR,FIC,NICON,SICH,TSTKNI\nQVAR\t:\tGVKEY\nfile\t:\tgfunda\nfreq\t:\tann\nBEG_D\t:\t01\nBEG_M\t:\tJan\nDATEF\t:\tDDMMYY10.\nEND_D\t:\t31\nEND_M\t:\tDec\nQUERY\t:\tnull\nBEG_YR\t:\t1997\nEND_YR\t:\t2020\nEXTRA1\t:\tC\nEXTRA2\t:\tINDL,FS\nEXTRA3\t:\tHIST_STD\nEXTRA4\t:\tI\nEXTRA6\t:\tNLD\nEXTRA7\t:\tA,I\nEXTRA9\t:\titems\nFORMAT\t:\tdta\nMETHOD\t:\t3\nextra8\t:\tCIK,CITY,CONML,DLRSN,FYRC,LOC,SIC\noutrep\t:\tsolaris_64\nqvards\t:\tg_chars\nDATEVAR\t:\tfyear\nlibrary\t:\tcompd\nsaslibs\t:\tcompd\nCOMPRESS\t:\tnull\nCUSTOM_FIELD\t:\tTijdsanalyse Controlekwaliteit\nSEARCH_OPTION\t:\tsrch_entire_method3\ncode_list_name\t:\tnull\nOUTPUTSCREENVAR1\t:\tCONSOL\nOUTPUTSCREENVAR2\t:\tINDFMT\nOUTPUTSCREENVAR3\t:\tDATAFMT\nOUTPUTSCREENVAR4\t:\tPOPSRC\nOUTPUTSCREENVAR5\t:\tCOSTAT\nOUTPUTSCREENVAR7\t:\tFIC\nPARAMETERIZED_WHERE_CLAUSE\t:\tnull\nretrieved_code_lists_method4\t:\tnull"
